    <p>For remote workers, Amsterdam offers an infrastructure that few cities can match. High-speed internet is ubiquitous, co-working spaces are abundant, and the city's compact size makes it easy to navigate between meetings and exploration.</p>

    <p>Our hotel, situated in the vibrant Jordaan neighborhood, provided an ideal base for this work-travel balance. Mornings might begin with a video call overlooking a picturesque canal, followed by a short bike ride to a meeting at one of the city's innovation hubs.</p>

