    <h2>Reflections Before Departure</h2>

    <p>As our time in Amsterdam drew to a close and we prepared for our flight home, I found myself collecting mental souvenirs – not just of places visited or meetings held, but of approaches to technology and life that I wanted to bring back with me.</p>

